"to v3.0 or higher."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../frameworks/espidf_extra.rst:479
msgid ""
"If Secure Boot or Flash Encryption is enabled, the reset method is set to "
"``no_reset`` to stay in the bootloader after uploading."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../frameworks/espidf_extra.rst:484
